&lt;h3&gt;Lead Partner Sales Engineer – FAME region&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Location: France (Remote)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Black Duck is looking for an experienced &lt;strong&gt;Lead Partner Sales Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to support our growing partner ecosystem across the &lt;strong&gt;FAME region&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a senior, partner-focused technical role where you’ll work closely with Black Duck’s strategic partners, enabling their technical teams to confidently position, demonstrate and deliver our application security solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll provide technical leadership across partner-led opportunities, deliver enablement and training, support demonstrations and Proofs of Value, and act as a trusted advisor to both partners and customers. The role combines deep technical expertise with the ability to build relationships, influence and scale technical capability through our partner network.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable and develop partner Sales Engineers and Solution Architects across the FAME region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver technical training, workshops, product demonstrations and Proofs of Value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support strategic partner-led customer opportunities and complex technical sales cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise partners and customers on Application Security, DevSecOps and software security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships with technical and commercial stakeholders across our partner ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Black Duck alongside partners at customer meetings and industry events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience in &lt;strong&gt;Sales Engineering, Solutions Engineering, Partner/Channel Engineering or technical consulting&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of &lt;strong&gt;Application Security, SCA, SAST, DevSecOps and modern software development practices&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with technology partners, resellers, integrators or other channel organisations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong presentation, demonstration and technical enablement skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable engaging everyone from hands-on technical teams to senior customer stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluent English and French, with Arabic highly desirable.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in &lt;strong&gt;France&lt;/strong&gt;, with flexibility to travel across the region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Why Black Duck?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity to take a senior technical role within Black Duck’s partner organisation, helping our partners develop the knowledge and capabilities they need to successfully take our solutions to customers across the FAME region.&lt;/p&gt;
